---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seats = [
  { tier: 'Community', price: '€333', monthly: '€111 a month', link: '' },
  { tier: 'Standard', price: '€666', monthly: '€222 a month', link: '' },
  { tier: 'Sustaining', price: '€888', monthly: '€296 a month', link: '' },
];
const paySeats = seats.filter((s) => s.link);
---

<Layout
  title="FLIP Program · Quest Labs"
  description="FLIP is a 12-week embodied, healing-centered futures development program. Join a crew, develop futures capacities, and practice radical foresight. Crew 02 forming now."
>

<div class="prog-page">

<!-- ── HERO ── -->
<div class="prog-hero">
  <div class="prog-hero-bg"></div>
  <p class="prog-hero-eyebrow"><span class="prog-hero-emoji" aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/slide.svg" alt="" /></span><span class="prog-hero-eyebrow-text">Futures Literacies<br>Invitational Playground</span></p>
  <h1 class="prog-hero-title">FLIP</h1>
  <p class="prog-hero-subtitle">The Questor's Invitational</p>
  <p class="prog-hero-sub">A 12-week adventure toward the future you haven't dreamed of yet.<br>Come meet your future Self.</p>
</div>

<div class="prog-divider"></div>

<!-- ── THE PREMISE ── -->
<section id="what" class="prog-what-section">
  <div class="prog-reveal">
    <p class="prog-section-label">The Premise</p>
    <h2 class="prog-section-title">Somewhere between 2026 and 2032,<br>there is a <em>portal</em>.</h2>
    <p class="prog-section-body">
      We're crossing a threshold into the unknown...<br><br>
      ...but don't lose hope.<br><br>
      A whisper of wisdom from beyond?<br><br>
      Remember, someone built this world.<br><br>
      We're here to build a new one.<br><br>
      Each season, 6 brave travelers move through 12 worlds together.<br><br>
      Each week the world changes: same crew, different questions.<br><br>
      We gather what serves our future Selves.<br><br>
      We unearth unknowns. <span role="img" aria-label="hole"><img class="emoji-img emoji-img--lg" src="/images/emoji/hole.svg" alt="" /></span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="prog-divider"></div>

<!-- ── CREW 01 ── -->
<div class="prog-earthday-section prog-reveal">
  <div class="prog-earthday-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="prog-earthday-inner">
    <div class="prog-earthday-globe" aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/earth.svg" alt="" /></div>
    <div class="prog-earthday-text">
      <p class="prog-earthday-eyebrow">Crew 01 · Founding</p>
      <h2 class="prog-earthday-heading">Launched<br><em>Earth Day 2026.</em></h2>
      <p class="prog-earthday-sub">The program is over<br>and still we quest.</p>
      <p class="prog-earthday-sub">The founding crew continues to quest.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="prog-divider"></div>

<!-- ── WAITLIST ── -->
<div class="prog-waitlist-section" id="waitlist">
  <div class="prog-waitlist-inner prog-reveal">

    <p class="prog-waitlist-eyebrow">Crew 02 · Join us</p>
    <h2 class="prog-waitlist-heading"><img class="emoji-img prog-rocket" src="/images/emoji/rocket.svg" alt="" /> Crew 02, let's go.<br><em class="prog-slow">Slow. <img class="emoji-img prog-rocket" src="/images/emoji/snail.svg" alt="" /></em></h2>
    <p class="prog-waitlist-body">We're looking for the next 6 travelers to start the year together.</p>
    <p class="prog-waitlist-body">Sign up and we'll get ready to map what's coming.</p>
    <p class="prog-waitlist-body">Until then, <a href="#zineForm" class="prog-doors-link">explore the zine</a> or <a href="https://lu.ma/questlabs" class="prog-doors-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">come to a Sandbox Session</a>.<br>That's where it begins.<br>Come play.</p>

    <div class="prog-seat-box">
      <p class="prog-waitlist-body prog-price">A seat is €333 community · €666 standard · €888 sustaining.</p>
      <p class="prog-waitlist-body">You choose your tier.<br>It's flexible.<br>Let's build together.</p>
      <p class="prog-waitlist-body">FLIP is a community of practice.<br>Once a crew gets going, it keeps going.</p>
      <p class="prog-waitlist-body">A Community seat is less than €1 a day over a year.<br>Pay in full or in 3 monthly payments.<br>Or take the year, or take the season.<br>Move at your own pace.</p>
      <p class="prog-waitlist-body">Can't pay?<br>Come play.<br>Pop in when you can.</p>
      <p class="prog-waitlist-body"><strong class="prog-price"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/snowman.svg" alt="" /><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/sun.svg" alt="" /> Holiday snowball plan:</strong><br>It's the holidays, we know. <img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/melting.svg" alt="" /><br>Start paying in the new year, or spread your seat over 6 to 12 months.<br>We round down.<br><a href="/contact" class="prog-doors-link">Write to us and we'll work it out →</a></p>
      <p class="prog-waitlist-body prog-small">Prices are in euros. Your bank converts them for you.</p>
    </div>

    {paySeats.length > 0 && (
      <div class="prog-pay">
        <p class="prog-waitlist-body">Ready now? Pay and join:</p>
        <div class="prog-pay-row">
          {paySeats.map((s) => (
            <a href={s.link} class="prog-btn prog-btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/rocket.svg" alt="" /> {s.tier} {s.price}, let's go →</a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    )}

    <p class="prog-waitlist-body">Not in the cards right now?<br>Join the Community Crew for free.<br>Follow along on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/questlabs.world" class="prog-doors-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/quest-labs-education/" class="prog-doors-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>, and witness futures grow.<br>Your presence is the present. <img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/gift.svg" alt="" /></p>
    <p class="prog-waitlist-body">Want to hear when Crew 02 opens?<br>Sign up below, and <a href="https://lu.ma/questlabs" class="prog-doors-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">come join a Sandbox →</a></p>

    <form class="prog-waitlist-form" id="waitlistForm" name="cohort-02-waitlist" method="POST" data-netlify="true">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="cohort-02-waitlist" />
      <label class="prog-form-label" for="wlName">Your name</label>
      <input class="prog-waitlist-input" id="wlName" type="text" name="name" required />
      <label class="prog-form-label" for="wlEmail">Your email</label>
      <input class="prog-waitlist-input" id="wlEmail" type="email" name="email" required />
      <label class="prog-form-label" for="wlDream">Are you ready to activate your dream capacity this season?<br>Which dream is knocking?</label>
      <textarea class="prog-waitlist-input prog-waitlist-textarea" id="wlDream" name="navigating" rows="3"></textarea>
      <button class="prog-btn prog-btn-primary prog-waitlist-submit" type="submit">Sign me up. Let's go →</button>
      <p class="prog-zine-form-note">By signing up, you agree to how we hold your data.<br>Unsubscribe whenever you want.<br><a href="/privacy" class="prog-doors-link">Privacy</a> <span class="prog-pending">in review</span></p>
    </form>

    <div class="prog-waitlist-confirm" id="waitlistConfirm" style="display:none;">
      <p class="prog-waitlist-confirm-msg">You're on the list. We'll be in touch to prepare for the start of the year. In the meantime, the Sandbox Sessions are open. Come play.</p>
      <a href="https://lu.ma/questlabs" class="prog-btn prog-btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find a Sandbox Session →</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<div class="prog-divider"></div>

<!-- ── THREE WAYS IN ── -->
<section id="ways" class="prog-what-section">
  <div class="prog-reveal">
    <div class="prog-zine">
      <div class="prog-zine-stack">
        <img src="/images/zine/futures-alphabet-cover.webp" alt="The Futures Alphabet zine, folded, front cover" width="600" height="853" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <svg class="prog-zine-arrow" viewBox="0 0 170 80" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M10 58 C 34 18, 92 8, 150 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <path d="M126 24 L152 41 L124 54" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
      </svg>
      <div class="prog-zine-caption">
        <p class="prog-zine-kicker">A living document.</p>
        <p class="prog-zine-equation">Manifesto<br>+ Methodology<br>+ Spell</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prog-doors">
      <p class="prog-section-label">Three ways in</p>
      <ol class="prog-doors-list">
        <li>
          <span class="prog-doors-num">1</span>
          <div>
            <p class="prog-doors-title">Print the zine <span class="prog-doors-aside">(play today)</span></p>
            <p class="prog-doors-body">The Futures Alphabet is free for your email. One sheet of paper, a few folds, one snip, seven ways to play with the future.</p>
            <form class="prog-zine-form" id="zineForm" name="zine-download" method="POST" data-netlify="true">
              <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="zine-download" />
              <label class="prog-zine-form-label" for="zineEmail">Your email</label>
              <div class="prog-zine-form-row">
                <input class="prog-waitlist-input" id="zineEmail" type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />
                <button class="prog-btn prog-btn-primary" type="submit">Send me the zine →</button>
              </div>
              <p class="prog-zine-form-note">We keep the channel open to share new things with you.<br>Unsubscribe whenever you want.<br>How we hold your data: <a href="/privacy" class="prog-doors-link">Privacy</a> <span class="prog-pending">in review</span></p>
            </form>
            <div id="zineConfirm" style="display:none;">
              <p class="prog-doors-body">Thank you. Your zine is ready.</p>
              <a href="/downloads/futures-alphabet-zine.pdf" class="prog-doors-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-goatcounter-click="zine-download" data-goatcounter-title="Futures Alphabet zine PDF">Download the zine (PDF) →</a>
              <p class="prog-doors-body" style="margin-top:0.75rem;">Made something?<br>Post it and tag us so we can share it: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/questlabs.world" class="prog-doors-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a> · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/quest-labs-education/" class="prog-doors-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="prog-doors-num">2</span>
          <div>
            <p class="prog-doors-title">Bring it to a Sandbox Session.</p>
            <p class="prog-doors-body">Open door, donation based. Share what you made and play with others.</p>
            <a href="https://lu.ma/questlabs" class="prog-doors-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find a Sandbox Session →</a>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="prog-doors-num">3</span>
          <div>
            <p class="prog-doors-title">Or join the next crew.</p>
            <p class="prog-doors-body">12 weeks, 6 travelers. Your zine grows into a living document.</p>
            <p class="prog-doors-body prog-price">You choose your tier: €333, €666 or €888.</p>
            <p class="prog-doors-body">Pay in full, monthly, or over a season.<br>Can't pay? Come play.</p>
            <a href="#waitlist" class="prog-doors-link">Sign up for Crew 02 →</a>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="prog-educator-bridge" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
      <p class="prog-educator-bridge__label">Leading a school or a classroom?</p>
      <a href="/partner" class="prog-educator-bridge__link">Partner with us →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="prog-educator-bridge" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      <p class="prog-educator-bridge__label">Researcher? In the field of futures?</p>
      <a href="/foundations" class="prog-educator-bridge__link">The methodology, lineage, and framework behind every program →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="prog-divider"></div>

<!-- ── 12-WEEK JOURNEY ── -->
<div class="prog-journey-section" id="journey">
  <div class="prog-journey-inner">
    <div class="prog-reveal">
      <p class="prog-section-label">The Full Arc</p>
      <h2 class="prog-section-title">Every stage.<br><em>A question waiting.</em></h2>
      <p class="prog-section-body">12 weeks. 12 worlds. Each week, a companion walks with you.</p>
      <p class="prog-arc-aside">An arc that must be lived before it can be mapped.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prog-journey-flow prog-reveal" style="transition-delay:0.15s; margin-top:3rem;">

      <details class="prog-journey-phase prog-phase-descent">
        <summary>
          <div class="prog-journey-phase-header">
            <div>
              <div class="prog-phase-label">Phase I</div>
              <div class="prog-phase-name">Descent</div>
            </div>
            <div class="prog-phase-weeks">Weeks 1–4</div>
          </div>
          <ul class="prog-phase-chips">
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/elephant.svg" alt="" /></span> Safety</li>
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/sheep.svg" alt="" /></span> Identity</li>
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/swan.svg" alt="" /></span> Power</li>
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/turtle.svg" alt="" /></span> Integrity</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="prog-phase-toggle">Open the questions</span>
        </summary>
        <ul class="prog-journey-stages">
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Elephant" title="Black Elephant"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/elephant.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 1 · Safety</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Elephant</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">What would you begin today if you already knew you were allowed to?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Sheep" title="Black Sheep"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/sheep.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 2 · Identity</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Sheep</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">Which version of yourself have you been performing, and which one have you been protecting?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Swan" title="Black Swan"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/swan.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 3 · Power</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Swan</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">Where in the system are you a lever, and where have you been acting like a cog?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Marsh Turtle" title="Black Marsh Turtle"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/turtle.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 4 · Integrity</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Marsh Turtle</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">What do you say you believe, and what does your calendar say you believe?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </details>

      <details class="prog-journey-phase prog-phase-crossing">
        <summary>
          <div class="prog-journey-phase-header">
            <div>
              <div class="prog-phase-label">Phase II</div>
              <div class="prog-phase-name">Crossing</div>
            </div>
            <div class="prog-phase-weeks">Weeks 5–7</div>
          </div>
          <ul class="prog-phase-chips">
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/jellyfish.svg" alt="" /></span> Possibility</li>
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/sheep.svg" alt="" /></span> Abundance</li>
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/elephant.svg" alt="" /></span> Connection</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="prog-phase-toggle">Open the questions</span>
        </summary>
        <ul class="prog-journey-stages">
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Jellyfish" title="Black Jellyfish"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/jellyfish.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 5 · Possibility</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Jellyfish</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">Where in your body does the future you want actually live?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Sheep" title="Black Sheep"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/sheep.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 6 · Abundance</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Sheep</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">What have you been rationing (your joy, your ideas, your rest) as if there weren't enough?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Elephant" title="Black Elephant"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/elephant.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 7 · Connection</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Elephant</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">Who are the people whose futures are already braided with yours, whether you named it or not?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </details>

      <details class="prog-journey-phase prog-phase-emergence">
        <summary>
          <div class="prog-journey-phase-header">
            <div>
              <div class="prog-phase-label">Phase III</div>
              <div class="prog-phase-name">Emergence</div>
            </div>
            <div class="prog-phase-weeks">Weeks 8–12</div>
          </div>
          <ul class="prog-phase-chips">
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/swan.svg" alt="" /></span> Strength</li>
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/turtle.svg" alt="" /></span> Compassion</li>
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/jellyfish.svg" alt="" /></span> Self-Protection</li>
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/sheep.svg" alt="" /></span> Autonomy</li>
            <li><span aria-hidden="true"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/elephant.svg" alt="" /></span> Faith</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="prog-phase-toggle">Open the questions</span>
        </summary>
        <ul class="prog-journey-stages">
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Swan" title="Black Swan"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/swan.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 8 · Strength</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Swan</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">What would you build if you were building it from strength instead of from scarcity?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Marsh Turtle" title="Black Marsh Turtle"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/turtle.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 9 · Compassion</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Marsh Turtle</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">What would you allow yourself to be slow at, and what would open up if you did?</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-turn">✦ The turn to we</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Jellyfish" title="Black Jellyfish"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/jellyfish.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 10 · Self-Protection</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Jellyfish</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">What futures are you being asked to carry that were never yours to hold?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Sheep" title="Black Sheep"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/sheep.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 11 · Autonomy</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Sheep</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">What decision have you been waiting for someone else to make, that only you can make?</div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="prog-journey-stage">
            <div class="prog-stage-num" role="img" aria-label="Black Elephant" title="Black Elephant"><img class="emoji-img" src="/images/emoji/elephant.svg" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="prog-stage-content">
              <div class="prog-stage-name">Week 12 · Faith</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-companion">with the Black Elephant</div>
              <div class="prog-stage-prompt">You are still here. That is not nothing. That is everything.</div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </details>

    </div>

    <!-- CTA after reading the arc -->
    <div class="prog-journey-cta prog-reveal" style="transition-delay:0.25s">
      <p class="prog-journey-cta__text">Ready to begin your arc?</p>
      <a href="#waitlist" class="prog-btn prog-btn-primary">Sign up for Crew 02 →</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<div class="prog-divider"></div>

<!-- ── TESTIMONIALS ── -->
<div class="prog-testimonials-section">
  <div class="prog-testimonials-inner">

    <blockquote class="prog-testimonial prog-reveal">
      <p class="prog-testimonial__quote">"She's not only listening to what you're saying verbally, but she's also listening to your tone, your word choice; she's able to develop a more well-informed understanding of your state and situation. Makēda has been an invaluable source of support for me."</p>
      <cite class="prog-testimonial__cite">Stephanie · building a music career</cite>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote class="prog-testimonial prog-reveal" style="transition-delay:0.15s">
      <p class="prog-testimonial__quote">"By asking the right questions, providing the right tools, and being very supportive, Makēda helped me succeed in my academic studies, personal life, and with a difficult transition towards my professional life. Today I am much happier."</p>
      <cite class="prog-testimonial__cite">Etienne · navigating a life transition</cite>
    </blockquote>

  </div>
</div>


<!-- ── CLOSING ── -->
<div class="prog-closing-section">
  <p class="prog-closing-quote prog-reveal">"We need every dream. Especially yours.<br>Start where you are to get where we're going."</p>
  <p class="prog-closing-attr prog-reveal" style="transition-delay:0.15s">— Quest Labs</p>
</div>

